# =============================================================================
# RPM AVOIDANCE BANDS
# TBD: Upload from Phase G structural dynamics report
# =============================================================================
#
# Avoidance bands are configured via external file:
#   APM/config/rpm_bands.txt
#
# File format: CSV with columns MIN_RPM, MAX_RPM, TYPE, DESCRIPTION
# TYPE values: "absolute" (rotor RPM range) or "delta" (differential RPM range)
#
# Software enforces avoidance bands and triggers auto RTL on violation.
# See minime_test_modes.lua for enforcement implementation.
